{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Ensures a session id has a live row in the asking user's chat index. Called by the chat UI right after it saves a session record through app.write, so the sidebar always reflects the store — including a new session's first save and any save whose index row was lost. Verifies the record exists and belongs to the asking user (data.username) before upserting; never asserts a session the store doesn't hold for this user. Returns {status, id, touched}.\n\nInputs:\n- `id` (*string*): The session record id returned by app.write.\n- `nn_sessionid` (*string*): Auto-injected request metadata; resolves the user. Pass null from javascript.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;","params":[{"desc":"The session record id (returned by the app.write that saved the session).","name":"id","type":"String"},{"desc":"Request metadata auto-injected by the framework; resolves the user server-side. Pass null from javascript.","name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"sgkymg1a0f6cc40cfx82b","readers":[],"time":1790847010958,"username":"system","writers":[]}